* gut g u t 3rd t
* low l o w 3rd w
* cat c a t 3rd t

Negatives break the third-letter condition: ear r, cop p, ego o / not CVC, mom m, ate e / not CVC. The third-letter set also implies the e,m,r,p-free inventory on the exemplars.

On the five candidates:
leg l e g – CVC, V=e ∉ {a,o,u}, 3rd=g ∉ {d,b,t,w}
